# The second part of pearl_rot_sm120.cubin, the RTX 50 loop without shared records (probes/hand89/build_rot.py
# --arch sm_120n), one line for each cubin of it that has mined on a card with every hit verified:
#   <toolkit release> <hash>
# As pearl_rot_sm120.ref: build_rot.py --arch sm_120 puts this part behind its own only when what it built is listed
# here for the toolkit that built it, and the host loads the part only when its hash is in kRotCubins
# (pearl_host_rot.inc). A line is added only after the part has run on an RTX 50 card: probes/verify-hits.js 400 of
# 400 with PEARL_ROT_PLAIN=1.
#
# sm_120's keys without sr and srp: every warp reads records of its own. It holds 0.17 points more of the pipe and
# spends more energy, so the core turns it on only while no power cap holds the card's clock (pearl_core.cc).
